# MASTER PROMPT — GALACTIC NEUROCREW
## NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026 | Functional Educational Game Prototype

Act as a senior multidisciplinary development team composed of a game designer, front-end engineer, UX/UI designer, accessibility specialist, educational content designer, and scientific data integration engineer.

Your task is to **design and build a complete, functional, responsive, inclusive 2D educational video game prototype** called **GALACTIC NEUROCREW**, intended for children aged 7–12.

The application will be developed in **Google AI Studio Build** and must be ready to run in a web browser, be published on GitHub Pages, and be prepared for a future Android Studio integration.

Do not deliver only a visual mockup, a landing page, a dashboard, or a static demonstration. Build a playable experience with working screens, game mechanics, decisions, resource management, consequences, level progression, replayability, NASA data integration, and a final mission report.

